  article.portfolio-about
    .inner-wrapper
      .about-intro-box.box
        h1 Roxanne Perron
        p QA Analyst / Aspiring Full Stack Developer

        .about-bio
          p I'm a QA Analyst who is passionate about technology, automation, and software development.
          p My career began in software support and integration before moving into quality assurance, where I developed strong analytical and troubleshooting skills. Alongside my professional experience, I am currently completing the Full Stack JavaScript Techdegree, where I am strengthening my skills in front-end and back-end development.
          p Today, I'm expanding my expertise in test automation, programming, and DevOps practices such as CI/CD, Docker, and Kubernetes. I enjoy learning how systems work, improving workflows through automation, and building software solutions.
          p My goal is to continue growing as a technical professional by combining quality assurance, software development, and DevOps skills while contributing to the delivery of reliable and high-quality products.


